# Compiled controllers. Build them from source (tools/build-controllers.sh or Webots' Build
# button). Webots runs whatever .class it finds and never rebuilds it by itself, so a committed
# .class goes stale (the one previously committed here was built from an older version).
*.class

# Output of tools/run-tests.sh (JUnit jar, compiled classes)
build/

# Files Webots writes next to a world when it is opened
worlds/.*.wbproj
worlds/.*.jpg
